  "description": "WPF UI components for license-management.com end-user SDK. Provides ready-to-use Window and UserControl components, view models, and converters for license registration and management workflows. Bundles all required dependencies for easy deployment.",
  "id": "LicenseManagement.EndUser.Wpf",
